# Every run writes a file here. They are measurements of one machine at one moment, not
# artifacts anyone else can act on: the committed record is `../baseline.json` and
# `docs/performance/redirect-baseline.md`, both of which name the machine that produced
# them. A results directory in git turns into a log nobody prunes.
#
# The directory itself is tracked (this file) so `pnpm loadtest` and the CI job have
# somewhere to write on a fresh clone.
*.json
